OL,3,CGatwick to open second runway as
OL,4,Ccampaigners lose bid to challenge
OL,5,Cexpansion
OL,7,FGatwick will go ahead with plans for a
OL,8,Fsecond runway after campaigners lost a
OL,9,Fbid to take their legal fight against
OL,10,Fthe Government over expansion to the
OL,11,FCourt of Appeal.
OL,13,FPeter Barclay and campaign group
OL,14,FCommunities Against Gatwick Noise
OL,15,FEmissions (Cagne) previously took
OL,16,Flegal action against the Department
OL,17,Ffor Transport over the decision to
OL,18,Fapprove the plans, including over
OL,19,Fclaims that the Government did not
OL,20,Fproperly assess the climate impact of
OL,21,Fthe scheme.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/7
