OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785937683
OL,3,CGatwick to open second runway as
OL,4,Ccampaigners lose bid to challenge
OL,5,Cexpansion
OL,7,FThe #2.2 billion expansion, approved
OL,8,Fby Transport Secretary Heidi Alexander
OL,9,Fin September, will see the West Sussex
OL,10,Fairport move its emergency runway 12
OL,11,Fmetres north to accommodate around
OL,12,F100,000 more flights a year.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
