OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785937683
OL,3,CGatwick to open second runway as
OL,4,Ccampaigners lose bid to challenge
OL,5,Cexpansion
OL,7,FMr Justice Mould dismissed the
OL,8,Fchallenges in June, finding that it
OL,9,Fwas "neither illogical nor
OL,10,Fcontradictory" for Mrs Alexander not
OL,11,Fto refuse the proposed development "on
OL,12,Fthe basis that it would have a
OL,13,Fmaterial impact on the ability of
OL,14,FGovernment to meet its carbon
OL,15,Freduction targets".
OL,26,@qD@EOUrD@NO]sD@dOUwD@RO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/7
