CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785937683
OL,3,CGatwick to open second runway as
OL,4,Ccampaigners lose bid to challenge
OL,5,Cexpansion
OL,7,FHe also rejected an argument about the
OL,8,Fneed for the expansion at Gatwick,
OL,9,Fgiven the proximity to Heathrow.Last
OL,10,Fmonth, Mr Barclay and Cagne asked the
OL,11,FCourt of Appeal to allow them to
OL,12,Fchallenge the ruling, claiming that
OL,13,Fthe judge was wrong.
OL,15,FBut in a ruling on Tuesday, Lord
OL,16,FJustice Holgate and Lord Justice Dove
OL,17,Fdismissed the appeal bids.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/7
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
