PN,38805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785937683
OL,3,CGatwick to open second runway as
OL,4,Ccampaigners lose bid to challenge
OL,5,Cexpansion
OL,7,FIn a 29-page ruling, they said: "We
OL,8,Fconclude that each of the grounds of
OL,9,Fappeal raised by each appellant is
OL,10,Funarguable.
OL,12,F"Neither appeal has a real prospect of
OL,13,Fsuccess. We also consider that there
OL,14,Fare no other compelling reasons for
OL,15,Feither appeal to be heard."
OL,17,FThe two senior judges also said that
OL,18,FMr Justice Mould's ruling was
OL,19,F"detailed and thorough".
OL,26,@oD@aOUtD@AOUwD@[O]{D@AOU{D@WO]
