OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785937683
OL,3,CGatwick to open second runway as
OL,4,Ccampaigners lose bid to challenge
OL,5,Cexpansion
OL,7,FGatwick is the UK's second busiest
OL,8,Fairport and one of the busiest single-
OL,9,Frunway airports in the world.
OL,11,FThe expansion will allow the site to
OL,12,Fbe used for the departures of narrow-
OL,13,Fbodied planes such as Airbus A320s and
OL,14,FBoeing 737s.
OL,16,FHeidi Alexander, Transport Secretary,
OL,17,Fsaid: "This is a major milestone for
OL,18,FGatwick for local communities, with
OL,19,Fexpansion unlocking investment and
OL,20,Fcreating thousands of new jobs.
OL,26,@yD@GOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/7
