OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,389,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F388A1785937683
OL,3,CGatwick to open second runway as
OL,4,Ccampaigners lose bid to challenge
OL,5,Cexpansion
OL,7,F"Around 13 million more passengers and
OL,8,F100,000 more flights will give
OL,9,Fholidaymakers greater choice and
OL,10,Fstrengthen global links to help make
OL,11,Fthe UK one of the most attractive
OL,12,Fplaces in the world to invest.
OL,14,F"We'll back expansion that supports
OL,15,Fgrowth and our climate goals. To drive
OL,16,Fforward sustainable change, we're also
OL,17,Finvesting over #219m for green fuel
OL,18,Fproduction to cut emissions from
OL,19,Fflying and secure the future of
OL,20,Faviation."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU|D@JO]
